          "name": "Body 3. SCREENS (left → right)",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- Eval — Streaming (code kata, tests passed)\n- Eval — Follow-up\n- Eval — Error\n- Post-kata / Mobile — Streaming · Result (right line) · Result (wrong line) · Stream error (D60, D61; drawn ahead of the code, ships with it)\n- Post-kata / Mobile — Feedback inline · More feedback (D62)\n- Post-kata / Mobile — Result · new piece: the practitioner receipt as shipped (#229), between the notes and the exits; renders captured from the app\n- Post-kata / Mobile — Proposed · comeback after NEEDS WORK: the Moon window path (#224, D65, D66; proposal PNG, not shipped — the receipt half shipped above)",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AW0M9",
          "name": "Heading 4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "fill": "$color-accent",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.55
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "h4HUOS",
          "name": "Body 4. BUSINESS RULES",
          "fill": "$color-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- WS /ws/sessions/:id; on 'ready' it reads the attempt id from sessionStorage and submits once; 'Try again' after an error reconnects to the same attempt (useEvaluationStream.ts)\n- A final evaluation redirects to /result 1500ms after complete\n- Follow-up turns have no client cap; a failed follow-up submit releases the Send button\n- WS close 4001 clears the token and redirects to /?error=session_expired\n- On error the bottom band reads 'Evaluation stopped.'\n- D60: one post-kata screen, no redirect. The sensei streams into the verdict card's body; the verdict label and its ink colour appear only when the evaluation lands (neutral border stroke while streaming). The learner's line (lines ±1) and why sit below from the first token, so nothing moves when the result arrives.\n- Insight tags (<strengths>, <improvements>, <approach_note>) never reach the screen while streaming.\n- After evaluation only: the answer (rubric answer.line ±1, expectedIssues[].title and why) under the learner's answer.\n- Exit: Done is the filled action (to the dashboard's done state); One more kata and Share are ghosts (D54, D61). Share opens navigator.share, else copies the link.\n- D62: once the verdict is final, the time-limit and sensei-review questions sit open above the exits; each tap saves (upsert per session). Clarity and the note sit behind More feedback; the note saves with a ghost Send note. Done stays the only filled action.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
